1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:05,000
DNA-Replikation

2
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:45,000
Nukleotid = Phosphat + Zucker + Base

3
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:08,000
Purine: Adenin, Guanin · Pyrimidine: Thymin, Cytosin

4
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:20,000
RNA: Ribose + Uracil (statt Thymin)

5
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:50,000
A–T: 2 Wasserstoffbrücken · G–C: 3 Wasserstoffbrücken

6
00:01:55,000 --> 00:02:12,000
Antiparallel: 5' → 3' (Glowstone = 5', Froschlicht = 3')

7
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:55,000
Semikonservativ: je 1 alter + 1 neuer Strang

8
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:30,000
Topoisomerase: entspannt die DNA vor der Gabel

9
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:50,000
Helikase: spaltet Wasserstoffbrücken

10
00:03:50,000 --> 00:04:05,000
Replikationsgabel

11
00:04:30,000 --> 00:05:05,000
Primase setzt RNA-Primer (Startstück)

12
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:35,000
DNA-Polymerase: baut nur 5' → 3'

13
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:55,000
Leitstrang: kontinuierlich

14
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:40,000
Folgestrang: Okazaki-Fragmente

15
00:06:45,000 --> 00:07:00,000
Ligase verbindet die Fragmente

16
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:25,000
2 identische DNA-Moleküle (semikonservativ)

17
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:48,000
Fehlerrate ≈ 1 : 1.000.000.000

18
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:58,000
Entspiralisieren → Öffnen → Primer → Synthese → Ligation
